V=100 $\text{ volt }$ Given, $\lambda_0=de-Broglie wavelength of $proton \therefore \quad \lambda_0=$\frac{h}{\sqrt{2 m_p q_p V}}$ de-Broglie wavelength of $\alpha$-particle $\begin{aligned}
